    "lawCode": "Amd §13, Chap 600 of 1993",
    "lawSection": "Environmental Conservation Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S5332\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\nAn act\nto amend chapter 600 of the laws of 1993, amending the environmental\nconservation law relating to the management of bear, in relation to the\neffectiveness of such chapter\n\nPURPOSE:\nTo extend the law allowing for hunting of bear until\nOctober 1, 2015.\n\nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\nExtends the law allowing for hunting\nof bear until October 1, 2015 from October 1, 2011.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\nThis legislation is necessary to ensure that hunting of\nbear within New York is legal for the period of time between October\n1, 2011 and October 1, 2015.\n\nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\nNew Bill.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\nNone.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
